---
id: exp-block-result-analysis
title: Result and analysis block contract
date: 2026-05-19
primary_reaction: rxn-main
primary_result: res-main
primary_analysis: ana-tlc
---

:::chemd #mol-start
kind: molecule
name: cyclohexanone
smiles: O=C1CCCCC1
:::

:::chemd #mol-product
kind: molecule
name: cyclohexanol
smiles: OC1CCCCC1
:::

:::chemd #rxn-main
kind: reaction
reactants: @mol-start
products: @mol-product
reagents: NaBH4
solvent: MeOH
temperature: 25 C
time: 45 min
:::

:::result #res-main
ref: rxn-main
reaction: rxn-main
product: mol-product
status: success
yield: 84 %
conversion: 96 %
selectivity: 94 %
isolated_mass: 210 mg
product_state: white solid
purity: 99 %
notes: isolated by evaporation and trituration
:::

:::analysis #ana-tlc
type: tlc
ref: rxn-main
time: 45 min
eluent: petroleum ether/ethyl acetate 4:1
p1: sm 0.60
p2: rxn 0.28 ^3(4) | sm 0.60 v1
p3: product 0.28
:::

:::analysis #ana-hplc
type: hplc
ref: res-main
instrument: Agilent 1260
method: area normalization
result: 99% area product peak
data: Main peak at 4.8 min with trace impurity.
notes: confirms product purity
:::
